{"version":1,"content":"<p>好多女性極度重視美白，皆因「一白遮三醜」呢個概念深入民心，一般人嘅審美觀都認定肌膚白裏透紅就係靚，能夠喺人群中展現出耀眼光芒！</p><p>今日同大家見面嘅一之瀬光，正正因為有一身嫩白美肌，被人稱為寶石級美少女。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T14:24:00.508430+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:20.648382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T14:17:20.648382+00:00","content_hash":"9118aacb952255e5c46c7dc098551ec3cdcbe7b18e68233e6c653e708b860c78","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}